Assets used from Unity Asset Store:
AllSky Free - 10 Sky / Skybox Set - https://assetstore.unity.com/packages/2d/textures-materials/sky/allsky-free-10-sky-skybox-set-146014
Skybox Series Free - https://assetstore.unity.com/packages/2d/textures-materials/sky/skybox-series-free-103633
Procedural Terrain Painter | FREE - Automatic Terrain Texturing - https://assetstore.unity.com/packages/tools/terrain/procedural-terrain-painter-free-automatic-terrain-texturing-188357
Lava Rocks Texture #2 (Hand-painted, Seamless + Tileable) - https://assetstore.unity.com/packages/2d/textures-materials/floors/lava-rocks-texture-2-hand-painted-seamless-tileable-232056

Gen AI was used for:
Helping to successfully merge the different complex prototype mechanics made by different people in the group.
Identifying weak points in the structure of the game.
Debuging system for each character and their ability.
Complex maths i.e whip animations, complex raycasting, fine tuning numbers to make the game balanced
Cleaning up the messy bits of the code.
Temporary effects before we created our own particle effects.
Initial steps for the implementations of complex mechanics to give us basis to work on.
